== Effects ==
* Heals one {{e|Red Heart}}.
* Grants one {{e|Soul Heart}}.
* Upon entering a {{r|Boss Room}}, grants a shield that blocks one hit. If the shield is not used by the time the player leaves the room, the shield will disappear.

== Notes ==
* The shield will be granted regardless of whether the Boss Room is already cleared.
* This item's shield effect has the same synergies and interactions as {{I|Holy Mantle}} with the only difference being that when paired with Holy Mantle or {{c|The Lost|r}}'s innate shield it can still reapply later into the run. For a list of synergies and interactions, visit that page.
* Multiple Blankets will only give 1 shield.
* In [[Greed Mode]], this item grants a shield only for the two boss fights on the final level. The shield does not activate for the regular boss waves on previous floors.
* To quickly unlock this item, keep restarting [[Greed mode]] to enter its {{r|Curse Room}} which occasionally contains a bed.

== Interactions ==
* {{p|IV - The Emperor?}}: A shield is granted upon teleporting to the extra boss room.

