== Trivia ==
* Blanket is based on [https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1090362016 this Steam Workshop item] by P.5000 and Ratlah, originally known as Security Blanket.
** A "security blanket" is a common type of childhood [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Comfort_object comfort object], an item which provides psychological comfort.
* The blanket's appearance (being worn around the neck as a cape) and blue color is similar to the outfit of [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pajama_Sam Pajama Sam], a character who also wears a blanket as a cape. This trait is shared with {{i|PJs}}.
* This item is part of a set of bedtime-themed items, including {{i|Binky}}, {{i|Mr. Dolly}}, {{i|Night Light}}, and {{i|PJs}}.

